 Brutal pieces hit unshielded pieces, bleeding HP damage every turn for 3 turns.UI, SFX, VFX ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T21:56:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3808810-1839676055892993","game_id":"steam-3808810","kind":"announcement","title":"Prismarch - The Prism","summary":"Hello chess lovers!If you missed it -The official release date for Prismarch is October 27th, 2026! 🎉Things are getting close!Today, Prismarch v0.6.3 (Demo v1.3) is LIVE!A brief but non-exhaustive list of the changes is as follows:Added a toon shader to the chess pieces and certain objects. They should look more cartoonish.Main MenuVarious improvements to the buttons, visualsHub WorldMany objects that were not able to be jumped on (pipes, stairs) can now be jumped on. Jumping should be more cons","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T17:10:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3808810-1832700592788045","game_id":"steam-3808810","kind":"announcement","title":"Prismarch - The Exchange","summary":"Hello Prismarchers!Today marks the first major content update for Prismarch, as we get closer to the full release of the game:Here's a brief overview of all the changes: General increase in performance and optimizationOptions menu UI Rework / PolishVideo setttings remember your resolution / fullscreen preferenceVideo settings properly scale the game UI all the way up to 5120x1440Addition of Audio settings with Master / Music / SFX volume sliders.Massively improved menuing cohesion in the escape ","occurred_at